{"id":33289,"slug":"victims-of-sin","title":"Victims of Sin","year":1951,"country":"Mexico","duration":84,"spine":1222,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/33289-victims-of-sin","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/36fb4cef4f102bfea894126f135a6005/of8Rq0ASveNgFq05NaHrExBLqFAJm1_large.jpg","description":"A treasure of Mexico’s cinematic golden age, this deliriously plotted blend of gritty crime film, heart-tugging maternal melodrama, and mambo musical is a dazzling showcase for iconic star Ninón Sevilla. She brings fierce charisma and fiery strength to her role as a rumbera—a female nightclub dancer—who gives up everything to raise an abandoned boy, whom she must protect from his ruthless gangster father. Directed at a dizzying pace by filmmaking titan Emilio Fernández, and shot in stylish chiaroscuro by renowned cinematographer Gabriel Figueroa amid smoky dance halls and atmospherically seedy underworld haunts, Victims of Sin is a ferociously entertaining female-powered noir pulsing with the intoxicating rhythms of some of Latin America’s most legendary musical stars.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Emilio Fernández","slug":"emilio-fernandez"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Ninón Sevilla","role":"Violeta","slug":"ninon-sevilla"},{"actor":"Tito Junco","role":"Santiago","slug":"tito-junco"},{"actor":"Rodolfo Acosta","role":"Rodolfo","slug":"rodolfo-acosta"},{"actor":"Rita Montaner","role":"Rita","slug":"rita-montaner"},{"actor":"Ismael Pérez","role":"Juanito","slug":"ismael-perez"},{"actor":"Margarita Ceballos","role":"Rosa","slug":"margarita-ceballos"},{"actor":"Arturo Soto Rangel","role":"Prison director","slug":"arturo-soto-rangel"},{"actor":"Francisco Reiguera","role":"Don Gonzalo","slug":"francisco-reiguera"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Emilio Fernández","slug":"emilio-fernandez"},{"role":"Script by","person":"Emilio Fernández","slug":"emilio-fernandez"},{"role":"Script by","person":"Mauricio Magdaleno","slug":null},{"role